      "id": "claim_0c99024b1dc34293933469273951d009",
      "statement": "Git invocations use per-call-site timeouts: 300 s default (add, commit, the ref fetch/checkout inside clone_git, init, rev-parse, symbolic-ref, check-ref-format, diff), 600 s for the clone itself, the ref fetch and --unshallow, 300 s for push, and 60 s for the pre-push ls-remote lookup.",
