    {
      "id": "claim_39ecdd3b633544f991fd816100e72301",
      "statement": "Every git invocation threads secrets=(token,) into run_git/run_git_status so stdout and stderr are passed through redact_text before reaching a log file or an exception message; redact_text masks URL credentials (scheme://user:***@host), authorization and private-token header values, and any literal occurrence of a known secret.",
