    {
      "id": "claim_8aae1dc06426436ab498596dda4c2041",
      "statement": "Push failures are non-fatal to the artifact: PushError is the single failure currency (IngestionError is converted into it), and WorkerLoop._run maps it to status='failed' with error='push failed: ...' (truncated to 500 chars) plus push_result {'status': 'failed', ...}, while the packaged wiki.zip stays downloadable and POST /wikis/{id}/retry re-runs the push. push.enabled=false skips the publisher entirely and records {'status': 'skipped'} without touching the remote.",
